 up to 400 Guests.</p>\n\n  <p>We ensure that our Private Aviation Unit achieves the highest standards in safety, security, and privacy. In addition, we offer the highest levels of professionalism throughout our service and catering sectors.</p>\n\n  <p>The unit provides private aviation services with the flexibility to travel 24/7. This includes all necessary trip preparations and fulfilling special requests through continuous follow-up, from the minute the aircraft takes off until it arrives safely at its scheduled destination.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"saudia-contact-card\">\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing\">For further information</h3>\n    <p><strong>Saudia Private website:</strong> <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.saudiaprivate.sa/\">www.saudiaprivate.sa/</a></p>\n    <p><strong>Call Centre:</strong> +966 9200 13310</p>\n    <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:spa@spa.sa\">spa@spa.sa</a></p>\n  </div>\n\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app